<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia May broad money M3 up 20.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Malaysia May broad money M3 up 20.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's broad money M3 expanded by 20.1 percent year-on-year in May, against 19.7 percent in April, the central Bank Negara said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Total annual loans growth stood at 29.5 percent at the end of May against 28.5 percent at the end of April, it said.  </p>
<p>	   MALAYSIA MONETARY AGGREGATES:</p>
<p>(Percentage change at end of period, year-on-year)</p>
<p>	     May 97	 April 97	  May 96</p>
<p>  M1	 10.0	     10.4	    13.2</p>
<p>  M2	 18.3	     17.6	    25.4</p>
<p>  M3	 20.1	     19.7	    25.5</p>
<p>Note: M1 - money in circulation and cash on deposit in banks</p>
<p>	 M2 - M1 plus time, savings and foreign currency deposits</p>
<p>	 M3 - braod money</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
